<img alt=\"趙麗穎（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250514/999394522100404224159842.png/5kzG3sHUeoHpJQTNzEsrsThrsPapVb7rLf9UYS3_VGE\"/><figcaption>趙麗穎（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙麗穎（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250312/976547059169497088183506.jpeg/zb1ISsj2FRDQA8b0046Nu945ap2lesVJQxiZ5UMYmeU\"/><figcaption>趙麗穎（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙麗穎（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250104/952281981817720832495203.jpeg/JRnHT9ifNmLPMHS-CDJo9nBIy9G2fGNgA0Ym0QNGJtE\"/><figcaption>趙麗穎（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙麗穎（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230523/737675962250170368529473.jpeg/eNq8NRL8QFyYBNCogQbSeI8VAQOvp62yIJ05OiCdOTo\"/><figcaption>趙麗穎（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙麗穎（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230523/737675960236773376532916.jpeg/VOgAe6P62nqxp3EdzklKD0DF5V2IjqLaqyYwXasmMF0\"/><figcaption>趙麗穎（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙麗穎（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250514/999394524772306944329165.png/b0jfpgX7M3GkBKW7kQfwJD89uMsqik8dHdfAvx3XwL8\"/><figcaption>趙麗穎（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>林志穎狂飆5台法拉利登大巨蛋　驚喜合體陳傑憲震撼畫面曝光</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T07:35:05.392623+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1106,"images":30,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}